        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>For render targets this must be called once per frame before calling <ref refid="classaby_1_1rhi_1_1vulkan_1_1_texture_1a0f5ab0437c4cf243edaabe5fe19c2c29" kindref="member">read_px()</ref> if the current frames pixels are required </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
